SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This license covers only the source code written for this project. It grants
no rights to the original game "Munkiki's Castles" (Nokia, 2003): its design,
levels, graphics, sounds, music and texts remain the property of their owner.
None of them is included in this repository or in its releases; the program
reads them at run time from a copy of the game supplied by the user.

This is an unofficial fan project for the preservation of old mobile games.
It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or supported by Nokia. "Nokia" and
"Munkiki's Castles" are trademarks of their respective owners and are used
only to say which game the engine is compatible with.

The firmware links the Lilka SDK, which is licensed under GPL-2.0.
